I walk over to them.
I speak to them.
"Hello, my name is Maya," I say.
"I come from Mexico."
They look at me and smile.
A girl among them speaks to me.
"My name is Sara," she says.
"These are Kiran and Vishnu."
I like to meet new people.
Sara asks me a question.
"Do you like to play doubles?" Sara asks.
"Can you play doubles?"
I reply happily.
"Yes, I like to play doubles very much."
"I can play well," I say.
Kiran says, "Very good."
"We need one more person to play."
"Let's start playing," Vishnu says.
I am going to play with them.
I am very happy now.
